meta {
  name: Restore Batch
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trash/{{deletedBatchId}}/restore
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Origin: {{clientUrl}}
}

docs {
  owner or editor. The path carries no workspaceId, so the batch identifies its
  own workspace and the permission check follows from that. An unknown batch and a
  batch in a workspace you cannot reach both return 404.

  409 carries the same meaning as the per item restores: something in the batch
  would come back underneath a parent that a different delete left in the trash.
}
